y":"These are GAME 1.0 pretrained models.\r\n\r\n## Datasets\r\n\r\n### Singing voice dataset\r\n\r\n~32h of manually labeled private data\r\n\r\n### Natural noise & accompaniments datasets\r\n\r\n- [DEMAND](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/chrisfilo/demand)\r\n- [MUSAN](https://www.openslr.org/17/) (speech part was filtered out)\r\n- [MIR-1K](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/datongmuyuyi/mir1k)\r\n- [MusicNet](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/imsparsh/musicnet-dataset)\r\n- [MUSDB18-HQ](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/quanglvitlm/musdb18-hq)\r\n- private Asian ethnic instruments dataset\r\n\r\n### Reverb dataset\r\n\r\n[MB-RIRs](https://zenodo.org/records/15773093)\r\n\r\n## Languages\r\n\r\nThese are native languages from the training data. The models should work well on other languages.\r\n\r\n| Language         | Code | ID   |\r\n| :--------------- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| English          | en   | 1    |\r\n| Japanese         | ja   | 2    |\r\n| Yue (Cantonese)  | yue  | 3    |\r\n| Chinese Mandarin | zh   | 4    |\r\n\r\n## Specifications\r\n\r\n| Specification | #Params | Details                                              |\r\n| :------------ | :------ | :--------------------------------------------------- |\r\n| small         | ~12M    | embedding dim: 128, num heads: 4, num layers: 4+8+4  |\r\n| medium        | ~50M    | embedding dim: 256, num heads: 8, num layers: 4+8+4  |\r\n| large         | ~100M   | embedding dim: 256, num heads: 8, num layers: 8+16+8 |\r\n\r\n## Acknowledgements\r\n\r\nData labels are provided by:\r\n\r\n- [挚彬Club](https://zhibin.club/)\r\n- [YQ之神](https://space.bilibili.com/102844209)\r\n- 小狼\r\n- [幽寂](https://space.bilibili.com/478860)\r\n\r\n## License\r\n\r\nThe model files apply [CC BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/) license.\r\n\r\n"}]